<title>POLAND: Polish bank BOS sees net rising 30 pct in 1997.</title>
<headline>Polish bank BOS sees net rising 30 pct in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's  Bank Ochrony Srodowiska SA (BOS), which starts bourse trade on Monday, sees its 1997 net profit rising by 30 percent to 65.7 million zlotys, the bank said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>BOS said its pre-tax profit was likely to grow by 25 percent to 102.6 million zlotys in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
